blind_context:
  programme:
    outcome: 'Complete the remaining canonical-data, learner-page integration, and
      external-portability work while preserving delivered #162 and #173.'
    current_goal: Prove Grade-9 Physics exit readiness and Grade-10 transition from
      canonical Grade-9 scope plus existing learner evidence, without a mastery percentage
      or second learner truth store.
    roadmap_revision: RM-V31-ISS169-EXIT-001
    roadmap_title: Grade 9 Physics learner independence and progression
  local_responsibility:
    work_package: WP-TA-105
    title: Prove Grade-9 Physics exit readiness and Grade-10 transition
    outcome: Deliver an auditable derived Grade-9 exit/Grade-10 transition view from
      canonical required scope and existing learner evidence, preserving unknowns,
      prerequisite blockers, optional enrichment boundaries, and the delivered Core2A/Core2B
      demand contract without a mastery score or second learner truth store.
    acceptance_statements:
    - Exit readiness is a derived query/report over canonical Grade-9 scope plus existing
      learner evidence, with secure, usable-but-fragile, known-gap and insufficient/unknown
      categories and no persisted readiness score.
    - Changed-demand evidence is recognized only from canonical Core2B exposure plus
      transfer metadata plus direct/no-help demonstrated evidence; Core2A or caller
      prose cannot manufacture transfer evidence.
    - Transfer availability, learner observation and transition-requiredness remain
      separate; authored changed-demand inventory alone does not block or defer Grade
      10.
    - Required/prerequisite known gaps block, unknown required evidence remains evidence-required,
      fragile evidence gets targeted rechecks, enrichment/later-grade gaps stay visible
      but non-blocking, and Grade 10 inherits explicit transition evidence rather
      than blanket recertification.
    - No material changes occur under Physics or Learners, and learner evidence ownership
      remains unchanged.
    - Exact-head guardrails and pinned V3.1 validation pass with generated manifest
      current.
  stable_constraints:
  - Do not add mastery percentages, probabilities, readiness scores or a second Grade-9
    state store.
  - Do not convert unknown/missing evidence into mastery or failure.
  - Do not make authored Core2B inventory alone a transition requirement.
  - Do not modify Physics or Learners canonical/persisted truth.
  - Do not persist derived Core labels, family refs or transfer dimensions into learner
    observations.
